{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Fill his house.</b> His house is full, and likewise מלא כל הארץ כבודו (the whole earth is full of His glory), for many have erred in thinking that the glory of HaShem is that which fills the world, in the sense of לה' הארץ ומלואה (to YHWH is the earth and its fullness)." "<b>Small or great.</b> An adjective with the definite article, and the noun's place is lacking, and likewise ועשיר יענה עזות (and the rich answers insolence) and מאכלו בריאה (his food is choice)."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:54.477451879Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}